This is Grodek.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.290
One UE mobile suit-type sighted in the city outskirts.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:46.830
Dispatch the Genoace units on standby immediately. {dispatch, sortie}

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:47.960
Emily!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:56.050
No good...

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.260
Without the Gundam, they won't be able to...

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:01.180
Why are you getting in the way, kid?!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:02.430
That's right.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:04.100
This is no matter for children!

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:10.810
Anybody who messes with our turf, Euba or UE, has to deal with Zalam!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:13.030
Yes, Don is right!

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:15.610
Euba can handle the UE by itself. {Euba by itself is sufficient to take on the UE}

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.450
Let us defeat them and win the glory!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.450
In the name of Euba!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.660
Zalam!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:21.580
Euba!

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:22.580
Zalam!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:23.370
Euba!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:24.450
Zalam!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:25.410
Euba!{FML, seriously}

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.080
Zalam!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:26.790
I'm sorry.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.290
I'll definitely come back to help you!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.280
Flit!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.210
I figured it wouldn't work!

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:09.960
Then I'll...

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:28.020
At least until Emily and the others make it to the spaceport...{spacedock?}

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:29.730
Flit...

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.520
