00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:38.190
The elevator to the spaceport!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.200
Largan?

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:52.370
Even the Gundam can't beat him?

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.040
Flit, are you alive?

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.130
Respond!

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:55.960
Largan!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.680
I'll buy you some time!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.090
Get back to the Diva!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:07.510
They say the AGE System's cooking up something incredible!

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.350
The AGE System?

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.180
That's right!

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:13.980
A new weapon that can beat this mobile suit!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.560
Vargas is already getting it ready!

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:16.440
